    "custom_rich_text_dfJnqi": {
      "type": "custom-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_y33jgJ": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Return Policy",
            "heading_size": "h0"
          }
        },
        "text_UhYFDJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This return policy is applicable within 14 days of receiving a jewellery order from<a href=\"http://www.pngjewellers.com\"> </a><a href=\"https://yooubypng.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://yooubypng.com/\">https://yooubypng.com/</a>. The entire amount will be refunded to the customer’s account within 10–15 working days of receiving the returned product.</p><p>To initiate a return for any jewellery purchased from<a href=\"http://www.pngjewellers.com\"> </a><a href=\"https://yooubypng.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://yooubypng.com/\">https://yooubypng.com/</a>, email us at cs@yooubypng.com or contact us on +1800 233 5005 & +91 8669660639.</p><p>The policy applies to jewellery only, unless specified otherwise.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Eligibility for Returns</strong></h2><p>Customers can request a 100% return within 14 days of receiving the jewellery order.</p><p>Returns can be initiated via:</p><ul><li>My Orders section on<a href=\"http://www.pngjewellers.com\"> </a><a href=\"https://yooubypng.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://yooubypng.com/\">https://yooubypng.com/</a></li><li>Customer Support: +1800 233 5005 & +91 8669660639</li></ul><p>Upon confirmation, the product can be returned at any YOOU by PNG store across India.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Conditions for Return Approval</strong></h2><p>Return acceptance is subject to the following mandatory checks:</p><ul><li>The product must pass Quality Assessment by our in-house Quality Assurance Team.</li><li>The item must be returned in its original condition, without signs of damage, tampering, wear, or alteration.</li><li>All original documents must be returned, including:</li><li>Original invoice</li><li>Product certificate(s)</li><li>Packaging, box, pouches, tags, etc.</li><li>Free items</li></ul><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Non-Returnable Categories</strong></h2><p>The 14-day return policy does not apply to the following:</p><ul><li>Customised, engraved, personalised jewellery.</li><li>Products purchased under the Lifetime Exchange / Lifetime Buyback program.</li><li>Product purchased by exchanging Old Gold / Old Jewellery / Bullion.</li><li>Products earlier exchanged under the 14-day Exchange Policy.</li><li>Bullion, Coins, Chips, Vedhani, and Silver/Gold Articles – these are strictly non-returnable and non-cancellable once purchased. Please verify before purchase. Orders where the product shows signs of wear, usage, alteration, breakage, resizing, or tampering. (Refund will not be processed.) Deductions will be according to company policy.</li></ul><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Packaging & Pickup Guidelines</strong></h2><ul><li>The customer must ensure safe and secure packaging during the return.</li><li>In case of receiving defective/missing/wrong product, return shipping costs will be covered by the company, and a label will be generated. But the customers will have to provide an unboxing video to claim a return & refund for the defective/missing/wrong product.</li><li>If required, a secure pickup may be arranged through an authorised logistics partner.</li></ul><p>In case of return pick-up:</p><ul><li>The shipment must be sealed in tamper-proof packaging provided by the courier.</li><li>Pickup will only be attempted after verification by the customer service team.</li><li>Returned items that are damaged or lost in transit due to improper packaging will not be covered under the return policy.</li><li>Customer shall hand over the package within 3 days of label creation. In case this timeline is not followed, kindly connect with our customer service team.</li></ul><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Note</strong></h2><ul><li>For returns after 14 days, kindly check our Lifetime Buyback policy.</li><li>All returns are subjected to quality confirmation by our Quality Assurance Team and verification that the packaging is complete with all documents, like original invoice copy, verified product certificate, etc.</li><li>Any mismatch in product weight during returns, beyond permissible tolerance levels, will be adjusted as per store policies.</li><li>Return shipping is free for defective/wrong products. But customers will have to provide an unboxing video to claim a return & refund for defective/wrong product.</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p>YOOU By PNG Jewellers retains the right to modify the terms and conditions for individual customers. In such a case, the customer would always be notified of the decision before the purchase.</p><p>Our team is here to assist you at every step.</p><p>For any support, write to us at cs@yooubypng.com or call +1800 233 5005 & +91 8669660639.</p><p>GSTIN: 27AAHCP4162E1ZH</p>"
          }
        }
      },
