    "custom_rich_text_9U9ypn": {
      "type": "custom-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_hjVpqM": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Refund Policy",
            "heading_size": "h0"
          }
        },
        "text_JaGWxd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>On return approval and successful quality verification, the refund will be processed within 10–15 working days from receipt of the returned product.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Refund Method</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Online payments (credit/debit card, net banking, UPI):</strong> Refund is processed via reversal of the original transaction. Bank timelines may vary.</li><li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD) / Bank Transfer:</strong> Refund credited via NEFT/IMPS to the customer’s bank account. Bank timelines may vary.</li></ul><p>Alternatively, you can choose to get the amount credited directly to your PNG Jewellers customer wallet.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Refund Amount</strong></h2><ul><li>The refund amount will be 100% of the actual invoice amount paid, subject to quality check.</li><li>If any coupon, discount, or promo codes were used during the original purchase, the refund amount would be reduced by an amount equivalent to the coupon, discount, or promo codes, as applicable.</li><li>Any refund arising from a weight variation in Made-to-Order (MTO) products will be processed within 7–10 business days. In the event of an increase in product weight, the customer will be required to pay the applicable additional amount.</li><li>The weight difference tolerance for MTO products is typically ±0.01 grams, but may vary.</li><li>In case of receiving defective/missing/wrong Product, the customers will have to provide an unboxing video to claim a full refund for the defective/missing/wrong product.</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p>YOOU By PNG Jewellers retains the right to determine the final refund value after quality evaluation.</p><p>YOOU By PNG Jewellers retains the right to modify the terms and conditions for individual customers.</p><p>Our team is here to assist you at every step.</p><p>For any support, write to us at cs@yooubypng.com or call +1800 233 5005 & +91 8669660639.</p><p>GSTIN: 27AAHCP4162E1ZH</p>"
          }
        }
      },
