    "custom_rich_text_3KFtpz": {
      "type": "custom-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_RgjRwY": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Exchange Policy",
            "heading_size": "h0"
          }
        },
        "text_XMheRA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At YOOU By PNG Jewellers, we strive to ensure an exceptional customer experience through transparent and customer-friendly exchange policies. The exchange process and value depend on the time of exchange and the product category.</p><p>To initiate the exchange on any jewellery purchased from <a href=\"https://yooubypng.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://yooubypng.com/\">https://yooubypng.com/</a> contact us at +1800 233 5005 & +91 8669660639. Upon confirmation, the product can be returned.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Product Eligibility</strong></h2><ul><li>Customised jewellery (personalised/engraved), pearls, and coral stone jewellery are not eligible for 14-day exchange but are eligible under Lifetime Exchange.</li><li>Products showing damage, alteration, tampering, cracks, breakage, or unauthorised repairs will not qualify for full-value exchange.</li><li>MTO (Made To Order) orders can be returned and refunded, but cannot be exchanged. And changes to MTO orders cannot be made after the order confirmation mail/message is sent to the customer.</li></ul><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Mandatory Documentation</strong></h2><p>The following must be submitted:</p><ul><li>Original invoice</li><li>Original diamond certificate (where applicable)</li><li>Product packaging, certificates, and documents</li></ul><p>An additional deduction applies if the original invoice is not provided.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Quality Verification</strong></h2><ul><li>A basic quality check will be carried out at the store.</li><li>Products eligible for exchange will then undergo a final appraisal by the Quality Assurance Team.</li><li>The final exchange value is determined strictly after quality confirmation.</li></ul><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Value Difference Handling</strong></h2><ul><li>If the new product value exceeds the exchange value, the customer must pay the difference. Additional payment for upgraded jewellery is subject to applicable GST at prevailing rates. Invoice will be issued accordingly.</li><li>If the exchange value exceeds the new purchase value:</li><li>For 14-day exchanges: the balance is refunded via the original payment method.</li><li>For Lifetime Exchange: the balance is retained as store credit for future purchases.</li></ul><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Processing Timelines</strong></h2><p>Exchange approval and processing may take 7–10 working days.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Note</strong></h2><ul><li>Exchange rates are calculated as per prevailing policies at the time of exchange and are subject to change.</li><li>Products can be exchanged for full value only once within 14 days. Subsequent exchanges fall under the Lifetime Exchange Policy.</li></ul><p>YOOU By PNG Jewellers retains the right to determine the final exchange amount based on quality appraisal. YOOU By PNG Jewellers also reserves the right to modify these terms and conditions for individual customers.</p><p>GSTIN: 27AAHCP4162E1ZH</p>"
          }
        },
