    "custom_rich_text_KC7CKm": {
      "type": "custom-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_r4be3B": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cancellation Policy",
            "heading_size": "h0"
          }
        },
        "text_gQWwKj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In case of any dissonance, YOOU By PNG Jewellers has the right to cancel any orders. A few reasons for cancellation from our end usually include, but are not limited to:</p><ul><li>Limitation or unavailability of the product in the inventory.<br/><br/></li><li>Inadvertent error in pricing or promotional offers.<br/><br/></li><li>Incorrect or incomplete product information.<br/><br/></li><li>Logistical issues.<br/><br/></li><li>Suspected fraudulent transactions or verification failures.<br/><br/></li><li>No response from the customer with regard to order-related queries.<br/><br/></li></ul><p>We also have the right to request additional details from the customer before accepting certain orders.</p><p>If your order is cancelled wholly or partially, or if extra information is required to process your order, we will notify you accordingly.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Customer-Initiated Cancellations</strong></h2><p>Customers may request cancellation only before the order is dispatched from our facility. Orders may be cancelled within 24 hours of order placement by contacting the Customer Support team via email at cs@yooubypng.com, or contact us on +1800 233 5005 & +91 8669660639.</p><p>Customer-initiated cancellations of bullions, chips, vedhani and silver articles will incur a 3% cancellation fee on the total order value.</p><p>Once the product is dispatched, cancellation requests will not be accepted, and the order will be governed by the applicable Return / Exchange / Buyback Policy.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Non-Cancellable Products (Exceptions)</strong></h2><p>Due to the nature of precious jewellery and bullion, the following categories cannot be cancelled under any circumstances once the order is placed:</p><ul><li>Customised, engraved, or personalised jewellery<br/><br/></li><li>Products purchased under special offers, flash sales, or promotional campaigns (where specified)<br/><br/></li></ul><p>For these products, customers may refer to the applicable Exchange or Buyback Policy, subject to eligibility and quality verification.</p><p></p><p></p><p>Any payment received for cancelled orders will be refunded as per the Refund Policy.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Notes</strong></h2><p>YOOU By PNG Jewellers reserves the right to modify or withdraw cancellation terms for specific orders.</p><p>All cancellation decisions are final and binding.</p><p>This policy must be read in conjunction with our Return & Refund Policy and Buyback Policy.</p><p>GSTIN: 27AAHCP4162E1ZH</p>"
          }
        },
