    "custom_rich_text_4z8Aek": {
      "type": "custom-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_gh4MKF": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Buyback<strong> </strong>Policy",
            "heading_size": "h0"
          }
        },
        "text_wkC4JR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This buyback policy is applicable to jewellery purchases from the website after 14 days of receiving it.</p><p>To initiate the buyback, send us an email to cs@yooubypng.com or contact us on +1800 233 5005 & +91 8669660639. Upon confirmation, the product can be returned at any YOOU By PNG Jewellers store across India.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Buyback Values</strong></h2><p>Buyback values of the following are calculated strictly on prevailing market/company rates, as displayed in store and policies at the time and place of buyback:</p><ul><li>Diamond</li><li>Gold Jewellery</li><li>Plain Platinum Jewellery</li><li>Solitaire</li><li>Precious Stone (Ruby, Emerald, Sapphire)</li><li>Bullion (Gold/Silver)</li></ul><p>Buyback value will exclude making charges, excise, GST, and other taxes.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Quality Check & Verification Process</strong></h2><p>All products submitted under the Buyback Policy must undergo:</p><ul><li>Initial Quality Check at the store to confirm eligibility.</li><li>Buyback value determination based on the final assessment.</li></ul><p>The final buyback amount is always subject to quality confirmation and purity/weight verification.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Mandatory Documentation</strong></h2><p>Customers must provide the following:</p><ul><li>Original invoice copy</li><li>Original product certificates (e.g., diamond certification, authenticity card)</li><li>Original packaging, wherever applicable</li></ul><p>Buyback cannot be processed in the absence of mandatory documents.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Note</strong></h2><ul><li>Customised jewellery (including personalised/engraved products) is eligible for buyback.</li><li>Buyback values are subject to change and are calculated strictly on prevailing market rates and policies at the time of buyback.</li><li>The store will perform a basic quality check after the product is received, and if eligible for buyback, you will be credited with the amount in cash up to a specified amount. The rest of the amount will be credited through cheque, RTS, or NEFT. It can also be credited to your PNG Jewellers account.</li><li>For buyback transactions exceeding ₹10,00,000, KYC documentation (PAN Card mandatory) will be required in compliance with applicable laws</li></ul><p>YOOU By PNG Jewellers retains the right to calculate the buyback amount of the product based on the Quality Assurance Team’s final appraisal. YOOU By PNG Jewellers also retains the right to modify the terms and conditions for individual customers.</p><p>GSTIN: 27AAHCP4162E1ZH</p>"
          }
        }
      },
