        },
        "text_Pr3mUN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>By accepting this privacy policy, you consent to <a href=\"http://www.pngadgil.com\">www.pngadgil.com</a> collecting and storing the information you provide on our website or mobile applications.</p><p>P N Gadgil Jewellers is committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring transparency in how your information is handled. By using the website or mobile applications, you agree to the collection and use of your personal information as described in this policy. All information will be handled in compliance with relevant data protection laws.</p><p><strong>Use of Collected Information:</strong></p><ol><li>The information collected by P N Gadgil Jewellers may be used for the following purposes:</li><li>To contact you regarding website or mobile application updates, services, and related news.</li><li>To improve the functionality and user experience of the website or mobile applications.</li><li>To analyze visitor data, including geographical locations, for better service optimization.</li><li>To inform you about special offers via email, which you can opt out of at any time.</li></ol><p>By contacting P N Gadgil Jewellers through email or mobile applications, you consent to receiving marketing communications. The company does not knowingly collect personal information from children or sell products to minors.</p><p><strong>Third-Party Services:</strong><br/><br/>P N Gadgil Jewellers may employ third-party service providers to assist with tasks such as product delivery, data analysis, and marketing. These parties will have access to personal information necessary for performing their duties but are prohibited from using it for other purposes.</p><p><strong>Legal Compliance:</strong><br/><br/>P N Gadgil Jewellers reserves the right to share personal information to comply with legal requirements, including court orders and subpoenas, without prior notice.</p><p><strong>Opt-Out Option:</strong><br/><br/>You have the option to unsubscribe from any communications at any time. Emails from P N Gadgil Jewellers will include an automated unsubscribe link. Alternatively, you can update your preferences or opt out of communications by emailing <a href=\"mailto:customerservice@pngadgil.com\"><strong>customerservice@pngadgil.com</strong></a>.</p><p><strong>Policy Updates:</strong><br/><br/>By using the website or mobile applications, you agree to this privacy policy. P N Gadgil Jewellers reserves the right to update, modify, or change this policy at any time. The company may also adjust the terms and conditions for individual customers as needed.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
