    "custom_rich_text_kF8fia": {
      "type": "custom-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_B9F4Ae": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Privacy Policy",
            "heading_size": "h0"
          }
        },
        "text_Rxdtzx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Accepting this privacy policy allows https://yooubypng.com/, to collect and store any information you provide on our website or mobile applications.</p><p>YOOU by PNG is committed to protecting your privacy and fully respects your desire to understand how your information will be handled and used. By accessing or using the website and native mobile applications, you expressly consent to our use and disclosure of your personal information in any manner described in this Privacy Policy. YOOU by PNG will ensure that all relevant legislation is complied with when handling your personal information.</p><p>The information collected by YOOU by PNG shall be used-</p><ol><li>To contact you about the Website or mobile applications and related news and Services available on the Website or mobile applications.</li><li>To monitor and improve the Website or mobile applications.</li><li>To calculate the number of visitors to the Website or mobile applications and to know the geographical locations of the visitors.</li><li>Update you on all the special offers available on the Website or mobile applications and provide you with a better shopping experience. This includes sending e-mails intimating the various offers. You may at any time choose to unsubscribe from such e-mail.</li></ol><p>On contacting YOOU by PNG through any means such as e-mails or mobile applications, YOOU by PNG reserves the right to use your contact details for marketing communications. YOOU by PNG does not knowingly collect Personal Information from children or sell its products to children.</p><p>SMS/RCS will be used as a communication channel.</p><p>We may employ other companies and individuals to perform functions on our behalf. Examples include delivering products, sending postal mail, analyzing data, and providing marketing assistance. They have access to personal information needed to perform their functions but may not use it for other purposes. Further, they must process the personal information in accordance with this Privacy Policy and as permitted by applicable data protection legislation. YOOU by PNG does not allow unauthorized persons or organizations to use any information that YOOU by PNG may collect from you through the Website and mobile applications.</p><p>YOOU by PNG reserves the right to share any of your personal information to comply with the court orders or other legal processes. Your personal information may be disclosed under such subpoenas, court orders, or legal processes, which shall be without notice.</p><p>We will always offer you the opportunity to unsubscribe from any service or update you have subscribed to if you choose to do so. Any e-mail we send you will contain an automated unsubscribe link so you can opt-out of that mailshot. Alternatively, you can change your preferences or opt-out of all e-mails or other communications by contacting YOOU by PNG by e-mail at cs@yooubypng.com.</p><p>By using the website or mobile applications, you signify your agreement to the terms of this privacy policy. YOOU by PNG reserves the right, in our sole discretion, to change, modify, add, or delete portions of the terms of this privacy policy at any time. YOOU by PNG Limited retains the right to modify the terms and conditions for individual customers.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
