    "custom_rich_text_e4Gk4F": {
      "type": "custom-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_DUgkmq": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Terms and Conditions",
            "heading_size": "h0"
          }
        },
        "text_reVam8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>1. Acceptance of Terms<br/>By using this website, you agree to these Terms of Use. If you do not agree, please do not use the website. SMS/RCS will be used as a communication channel.<br/><br/>2. Legal Agreement<br/>These Terms of Use constitute a legally binding agreement governing the services and usage of this website.<br/><br/>3. Website Content<br/>The content on this website is for general informational purposes and is subject to change without notice.<br/><br/>4. Accuracy & Liability<br/>Neither P N Gadgil Jewellers nor any third parties provide warranties regarding the accuracy, timeliness, performance, completeness, or suitability of the content. The company is not liable for any inaccuracies or errors to the fullest extent permitted by law.<br/><br/>5. Intellectual Property<br/>All content displayed, transmitted, or carried on this website is protected by copyright, trademark, and other intellectual property laws.<br/><br/>6. Restrictions on Reproduction<br/>This website contains proprietary material, including design, layout, graphics, and appearance. Reproduction is prohibited except in accordance with the copyright notice.<br/><br/>7. Service Suspension<br/>P N Gadgil Jewellers reserves the right to suspend or cancel services if technical issues such as viruses or system failures compromise security or administration.<br/></p><p>8. Prepaid Orders & Adjustments<br/>For prepaid orders, if a product’s weight differs from what is displayed on the website, the amount may be adjusted accordingly—either as a partial refund for lesser weight or an additional charge for higher weight.<br/><br/>9. Trademark Use<br/>All trademarks used on this website are acknowledged. Unauthorized use of trademarks is prohibited.<br/></p><p>10. Privacy & Information Handling<br/>The company respects user privacy and does not disclose personal information to third parties unless required by law or for delivery services.<br/><br/>11. Right to Refuse Service<br/>P N Gadgil Jewellers reserves the right to refuse service to any individual at any time.<br/><br/>12. Unauthorized Use<br/>Unauthorized use of this website may result in legal action and claims for damages.<br/><br/>13. Linking Policy<br/>Users may not create links to this website without prior written consent from P N Gadgil Jewellers Limited.<br/><br/>14. Governing Law<br/>Any dispute arising from the use of this website will be governed by the laws of India or other relevant regulatory authorities.<br/><br/>15. User Control Over Information<br/>Users will have control over the information they provide, and the company will address privacy concerns accordingly.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
