    "custom_rich_text_4w6Dri": {
      "type": "custom-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_UqcxgR": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping Policies",
            "heading_size": "h0"
          }
        },
        "text_EBjQYW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At YOOU By PNG Jewellers, we ensure your order is shipped safely, securely, and hassle-free. All products are fully secured during transit by a reputable provider. Every order is carefully packaged in tamper-proof and durable packaging to reach your doorstep in perfect condition.</p><p>Once your order is dispatched, you will receive the tracking (AWB) number to monitor delivery progress. The courier partner is selected based on serviceability to the shipping address.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shipping Estimates</strong></p><p></p><p><strong>Estimated shipping timelines:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>RTS (Ready To Ship) products:</strong> 2 days<br/><br/></li><li><strong>MTO (Made To Order) products:</strong> 21 days<br/><br/></li></ul><p>Please note that these are indicative shipping timelines and not delivery timelines. Actual delivery timelines may vary depending on the delivery location and the courier partner’s schedule. </p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Shipping Charges</strong></h2><p><strong>Domestic (India):</strong> Shipping is free of cost across India except for COD orders.</p><p>Currently, shipping is only available across India. We do not ship internationally.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD)</strong></h2><p>Cash on Delivery orders will incur an additional prepaid, non-refundable charge of 5% of the total order value.</p><p>Cash on Delivery is not available in the following cases:</p><ul><li>Orders with a value below ₹1,000<br/><br/></li><li>Orders with a value above ₹25,000<br/><br/></li><li>Bullion, Coins, Chips, Vedhani, and Silver/Gold Articles</li></ul><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Delivery to the Identified Recipient</strong></h2><p>For secure delivery, customers must provide the complete name (as per government-issued photo ID), full address, nearby landmark, pin code, and contact number.</p><p>At the time of delivery, the recipient must present one of the following original ID proofs:</p><ul><li>Passport</li><li>PAN Card</li><li>Driver's License</li><li>Voter ID</li><li>Aadhaar Card</li></ul><p>The courier agent will verify the ID and note the details for record purposes. Recipient cooperation is essential for successful verification and delivery.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Delivery Locations</strong></h2><p>Orders are delivered only to:</p><ul><li>Residential or office addresses</li><li>Store Pick-up</li></ul><p>Delivery to public places such as malls, hotels, restaurants, hostels, or streets is not available.</p><p>If the recipient is unavailable, the courier will attempt delivery up to three additional times. If still undelivered, the item will be returned to our facility.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Change of Shipping Address</strong></h2><p>Shipping details can be modified before dispatch. Once the product is shipped, no changes can be made.</p><p>Customers may also track their orders via the <em>My Account</em> section on our website.</p><p><strong>Note:</strong> Successful delivery is subject to the courier partner's terms. Incorrect or incomplete recipient details may lead to non-delivery.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Shipment Discrepancies</strong></h2><p>Please do not accept tampered packages.</p><p>On receiving the parcel, inspect it carefully. Report any of the following within 7 days:</p><ul><li>Damaged product or packaging</li><li>Missing items</li><li>Extra items</li><li>Suspected tampering</li></ul><p>To report, contact us at 1800-233-5005.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Damaged Products</strong></h2><p>If your order arrives damaged:</p><ul><li>Do not discard the parcel or product.</li><li>Contact us within 7 days of receipt.</li><li>Our investigation team will assess and take appropriate action.</li></ul><p>We cannot accept responsibility or process claims if damage is reported after 7 days.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Missing Products</strong></h2><p>Please inspect the package before accepting delivery. Report any missing items within 7 days by contacting our customer service. Investigations will be resolved within the next 7 working days.</p><p>Failure to report within the timeframe may result in the claim being void.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Non-Receipt of Order</strong></h2><p>Once shipped, customers receive a tracking ID via registered email. A delivery confirmation is also sent post-delivery.</p><p>If the parcel is not received despite the delivery notification:</p><ul><li>Contact us within 7 days.</li><li>Call: 1800-233-5005 or +91 8669660639</li><li>Email: cs@yooubypng.com</li></ul><p>We will investigate and resolve the matter within the next 7 working days. Delays in reporting may result in an inability to process refunds or complaints. Chargebacks raised without following due process will not be honoured.</p><p></p><p></p><h2><strong>Note</strong></h2><p>If the order value is above ₹2,00,000 or multiple orders are placed on the same day, the customer will have to provide PAN Card details for order confirmation & dispatch.</p><p>In case of transit damage, the customer will be required to provide photos and a written statement of loss.</p><p>YOOU By PNG Jewellers reserves the right to revise this shipping policy at any time without prior notice. Updated policies will be posted on our website.</p><p>Please note that these are the shipping policies of YOOU By PNG Jewellers. Shipments are also subject to the terms and conditions of our shipping partners.</p><p>GSTIN: 27AAHCP4162E1ZH</p>"
          }
        }
      },
