        "text_NYwq4X": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In accordance with the Information Technology Act 2000 and rules made thereunder and the Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020, the name and contact details of the Grievance Officer are provided below:<br/><br/>Mr Ajay Jadhav<br/><br/>Address: PNG Classic, Kapil Residency, Survey No. 15/01A, Baner Balewadi Road, Opposite Fatcook, Pune, Maharashtra – 411045<br/><br/>Email: cs@yooubypng.com</p><p>Phone: 1800-233-5005<br/><br/>Time: Mon-Fri(10:00-18:00)</p><p>-------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p><strong>Nodal Officer</strong></p><p>Name: Prakhar Gupta</p><p>Designation: Nodal Officer</p><p>Email Address: <a href=\"mailto:nodal.officer@pngadgil.com\">nodal.officer@pngadgil.com</a></p><p>-------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h3>BIS Hallmarking</h3><p>All our Gold & Diamond jewellery is BIS Hallmarked.</p><p>As per the guidelines issued by the Bureau of Indian Standards (BIS) and the Government of India, BIS hallmarking is mandatory only for gold jewellery and artefacts intended for retail sale.</p><p>Gold bullion (coins/bars) and vedhani (raw gold forms) are currently exempt from mandatory BIS hallmarking regulations. Therefore, hallmarking is not a legal requirement for these categories.</p><p>However, please be assured that all our bullion and vedhani products undergo strict quality checks to ensure purity and authenticity as per industry standards.</p><p>GSTIN: 27AAHCP4162E1ZH</p>"
          }
        }
      },
